{"ref":"BDB, אֲחִיטוּב","hw":"אֲחִיטוּב","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֲחִיטוּב</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. (</strong><em>my brother is goodness</em><strong>) </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  grandson of Eli <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 14:3\" href=\"/I_Samuel.14.3\">1 S 14:3</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 5:33\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.5.33\">1 Ch 5:33</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 5:34\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.5.34\">34</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 5:37\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.5.37\">37</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 5:38\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.5.38\">38</a>; father of Ahimelech <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 22:9\" href=\"/I_Samuel.22.9\">1 S 22:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 22:20\" href=\"/I_Samuel.22.20\">20</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(אֲחִטוּב)</span> v <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 22:11\" href=\"/I_Samuel.22.11\">11</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 22:12\" href=\"/I_Samuel.22.12\">12</a> (on identity of pers. v. Be <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 5:33\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.5.33\">1 Ch 5:33</a>).<br><strong>2.</strong>  father of Zadok <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 8:17\" href=\"/II_Samuel.8.17\">2 S 8:17</a> (= <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 18:16\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.18.16\">1 Ch 18:16</a>), but We rds. Ahim. son of Ahitub; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 5:38\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.5.38\">1 Ch 5:38</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezra 7:2\" href=\"/Ezra.7.2\">Ezr 7:2</a>; grandfather of Zadok <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:11\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.11\">1 Ch 9:11</a> <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 11:11\" href=\"/Nehemiah.11.11\">Ne 11:11</a> (on all cf. We l.c.)","next":"BDB, אֲחִילוּד","prev":"BDB, אֲחִיחֻד"}